  "hook_reason": "My track record of automating regulatory reporting to 100% accuracy and maintaining full governance compliance on multi-million-dollar programs directly addresses KBR's requirement for transparent reporting and strong governance within the Graduate Project Controller role.",
  "body": "The Graduate Project Controller role calls for effective cost management and budget analysis. I’ve directed a program portfolio valued at over $5M at ANZ, delivering releases on time while reducing infrastructure costs by 15%. The role also requires accurate forecasting and transparent reporting. At InfoCentric I automated regulatory reporting workflows to 100% accuracy, and at MYOB I reduced financial data reporting time by 90%. For governance compliance, I led a risk and compliance program at NAB ensuring 100% regulatory adherence. My collaborative approach is reflected in facilitating workshops for 40+ executives to align on strategy.\n\nI’d welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background in program delivery, reporting automation, and stakeholder governance can contribute to KBR’s projects. I’m available for an interview at your convenience and can provide further detail on how I’ve managed budgets and reporting to keep programs on track."
}
